{"id":"conciencia","lemma":"conciencia","pos":"noun","rank":1589,"glosses":["awareness (state of knowing something)","consciousness (state of having cognition and sensation)","conscience, morals"],"ipa":"/konˈθjenθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conciencias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-conciencia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom perdió la conciencia.","en":"Tom lost consciousness.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804367","words":[null,{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Podemos huir de todo, excepto de nuestra conciencia.","en":"We can run away from everything, except from our conscience.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693537","words":[{"g":"to prune","l":"podar"},{"g":"to flee, to run away"},null,null,{"g":"except"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"all kinds of things"]]},{"text":"Ella tenía una conciencia limpia.","en":"She had a clear conscience.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"cleansing, cleaning"}]},{"text":"Hizo su trabajo a conciencia.","en":"He did his work painstakingly.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"work, job"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Emití un juicio a conciencia.","en":"I made a judgment call.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461635","words":[null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"good judgement"},{"g":"to"},null]}]}